cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this formalization, please cite it using this metadata."
title: finitegeom
type: software
version: 0.1.0
authors:
  - family-names: Rudd
    given-names: Tavis
    email: "tavis@damnsimple.com"
    orcid: "https://orcid.org/0009-0003-6405-3275"
repository-code: "https://github.com/tavisrudd/finitegeom"
license: Apache-2.0
abstract: >-
  A Lean 4 formalization library for finite geometry, coding theory, and their
  interactions with algebra, combinatorics, and quantum information. The
  initial release provides a reviewer-scale foundation for cap-placement games
  and finite affine and projective geometry; later versioned releases add
  explicitly audited paper-facing theorem closures.
keywords:
  - Lean 4
  - formalized mathematics
  - finite geometry
  - coding theory
  - combinatorics
  - projective geometry
  - cap-placement games
